"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":0,"text":"Balestrero in the last row having problems firing up his Maserati, and was pushed backwards and forwards to bring it alive by push starting.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":0,"text":"Caracciola took the immediate lead, followed by Varzi, Stuck and Fagioli.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":1,"text":"At the end of the first lap, after 2m56s with a lap of 154 km/h average speed, Caracciola shot past the finish, seven seconds ahead of Varzi with Stuck a close third","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":1,"text":"Etancelin ended his race at the slow right-hand Eymatt turn, where he drove into the sandbags but was not injured.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":17},{"lap":2,"text":"Varzi swerves round Etancelin's car, hits the fencing and damages his rear axle; Stuck is second, 8 seconds behind Caracciola.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":3,"text":"Caracciola sets a lap record of 2m48.4s and leads Stuck by 12 seconds.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":4,"text":"Hartmann encountered gearbox problems at the Kiesgrube and spun his Maserati backwards up a slope but was able to recover.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":4,"text":"Lewis leaves the track and retires.","q":false,"c":15},{"lap":5,"text":"There was a good race for second place. Stuck, Fagioli and Rosemeyer were separated by only a second.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":5,"text":"Varzi pits to have the rear axle checked.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":6,"text":"Caracciola laps in 2m47s; Fagioli passes Stuck for second.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":8,"text":"Chiron spins on gravel and crashes; he is thrown out but not seriously hurt.","q":false,"c":14},{"lap":10,"text":"At the end of lap ten, while Stuck was passing the grandstand, the thread of his left rear tire separated and was flung in a high turn towards the pits.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":11,"text":"Caracciola laps in a record 2m44.4s; Stuck stops 45 seconds for a new left rear tire.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":13,"text":"By now the sky had clouded over and it started to rain between lap 12 and 13, at the beginning just a fine drizzle.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":13,"text":"Rosemeyer passes Fagioli for second; Brauchitsch stops a minute for rain tires.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":14,"text":"Rosemeyer, Fagioli and Lang stop for rain tires; Nuvolari up to fourth; Brauchitsch retires at his pits.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":14,"text":"Stuck stops for rain tires and hands his car to reserve driver Pietsch.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":15,"text":"Caracciola changes tires in 45 seconds; Nuvolari stops for new goggles.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":26,"text":"Hartmann retires; twelve cars left.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":33,"text":"Rosemeyer survives a huge slide and spin at Eymatt.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":34,"text":"Varzi passes Nuvolari for fourth.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":35,"text":"Rosemeyer refuels in 40 seconds and Fagioli goes second; Caracciola refuels in 55 seconds and keeps a sizeable lead.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":37,"text":"Fagioli refuels in 38 seconds; he and Rosemeyer are a second apart.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":41,"text":"Farina takes seven minutes to refuel from cans, dropping from seventh to ninth.","q":false,"c":7},{"lap":44,"text":"The rain stops; Farina repasses Sommer.","q":false,"c":7},{"lap":70,"text":"Caracciola wins from Fagioli and Rosemeyer; Varzi fourth, Nuvolari fifth, Lang sixth.","q":false,"c":0}]}